{"version":1,"id":"UCxa-K2lfBP3aC_iRnIoEszg","name":"Uinta Academy","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxa-K2lfBP3aC_iRnIoEszg","main":true,"sourceId":"9111b33d-b595-42f9-876d-5cb1146826e9","profile":{"channelId":"UCxa-K2lfBP3aC_iRnIoEszg","name":"Uinta Academy","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxa-K2lfBP3aC_iRnIoEszg","handle":"@uinta_academy","description":"Uinta Academy is a residential treatment center serving youth assigned female at birth ages 13–21 who struggle with attachment issues, mood disorders, maintaining interpersonal relationships, and/or healing after trauma. \n\nUinta’s unique blend of equine-assisted psychotherapy, trauma-informed therapy, research-based therapeutic milieu, and accredited academics promote long-lasting change. Our team of highly skilled and licensed professionals provides individual, family, and group therapy to ensure a personalized and supportive experience. \n\nOur equine program sets us apart. Horses possess incredible qualities that make them exceptional partners in the healing process. Just like humans, horses are herd animals with a social order. At Uinta, students learn to build trusting relationships with horses. The way they manages this process often mirrors their interactions with others, providing valuable insights and growth opportunities.\n\nJoin us in support of their healing journey at Uinta.","thumbnailUrl":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/zdptLPdjILdj9DPxlK5Iu5lvxGQ3JwqFwvHqI9sUalepTaBv4TxB8PpuIYr0p5kVEAWlkY52eqk=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","subscriberText":"21 subscribers","videoCountText":"22 videos","countrySelfReported":"United States","links":[{"title":"Website","url":"https://uintaacademy.com/","displayedText":"uintaacademy.com"},{"title":"Facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/uintaacademy/","displayedText":"facebook.com/uintaacademy"}],"observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:12:19.895Z","source":"youtubejs"},"assessment":{"channelId":"UCxa-K2lfBP3aC_iRnIoEszg","relevance":"strong","role":"organizati